    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="n1" value="The route is a small table owned by the domain: (brand_id, capability) to a mode. &lt;b&gt;One source of truth at a time&lt;/b&gt;: shadow writes native only to a scratch area no reader uses. Two live writers are never allowed." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="214" y="640" width="1190" height="60" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="acl" value="&lt;b&gt;ACL rules (inside the legacy adapter)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;No legacy field name, status code or id format in the domain or its protos  |  legacy id kept beside ours in a legacy_ref table  |  legacy errors mapped to gRPC codes, a timeout is UNAVAILABLE&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;money to integer satang, times to UTC  |  no other domain reads a legacy database or calls a legacy API  |  no personal data on the bus&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="24" y="740" width="1696" height="90" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
   </root>
  </mxGraphModel>
 </diagram>
